  "812920492": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1041457618,
   "children": [
    -1740021592,
    -649749603
   ],
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So, Anna, darling… where exactly is {PC}’s room?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1760977849": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1349890431,
   "children": [
    1221991064,
    -1197261672
   ],
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You know, Josef, I still remember when Anna and I used to do everything together. Shopping, parties, weekend getaways… ah, those were the days.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-685495518": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -927535680,
   "children": [
    354698794,
    -1941343596
   ],
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Adrian, dear, I just know you’re going to grow up into a strong, tall man like {PC}.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1212038537": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1349890431,
   "children": [
    -43815030,
    1202585797
   ],
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It’s funny, isn’t it? When we were younger, Anna had so many admirers. So many promising suitors.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2060582288": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1349890431,
   "children": [
    1234208869,
    -1750054529
   ],
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Josef, you must let me take you shopping sometime. I know a tailor who can make anyone look like a man of status.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1137944139": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -927535680,
   "children": [
    -309519595,
    -1310289335
   ],
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You know, Adrian, you have such a sweet face. Almost too sweet.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "654701748": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -927535680,
   "children": [
    -1307321743,
    1519470052,
    900946627,
    1859818531
   ],
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Adrian, sweetheart, tell me—do you even try with women, or are you just hoping one falls into your lap?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "60234038": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1041457618,
   "children": [
    1876305395,
    -1332559441
   ],
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "My, my! This place is shockingly clean.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-252190714": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1041457618,
   "children": [
    -1449451565,
    -1848271465
   ],
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Anna, it’s such a lovely day! Why don’t we lounge by the pool?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1221991064": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1760977849,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Yeah, life changes. People settle down, have families.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-43815030": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1212038537,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Yeah, she was popular. Still is.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1234208869": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2060582288,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "What, something wrong with how I dress?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "354698794": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -685495518,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "Uh… I’m 21.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-309519595": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1137944139,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Uh… thanks? I think?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1307321743": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 654701748,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "I—I try! I think…",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1740021592": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 812920492,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Why do you need to know that?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1876305395": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 60234038,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Why does that sound like an insult?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1449451565": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -252190714,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Mmm… I think I’ll pass.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1848271465": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -252190714,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Oh, come on, don’t be boring! Or are you just afraid my bikini will be too distracting?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1332559441": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 60234038,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh, no insult at all! I just assumed with men in the house, it’d be… less civilized.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-649749603": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 812920492,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh, no reason! Just… curiosity.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1519470052": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 654701748,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Oh, darling, thinking isn’t enough. Women like confidence! Charm! Mystery!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1310289335": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1137944139,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "I just hope no one takes advantage of you. The world isn’t kind to innocent beings.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1941343596": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -685495518,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Oh? Really? Huh. Well, there’s still time, I suppose.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1750054529": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2060582288,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh, no, dear, not wrong—just… a little modest for a man married to someone as beautiful as Anna.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1202585797": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1212038537,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "And yet… she chose stability over excitement. Not what I expected, honestly.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1197261672": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1760977849,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Mmm, some people do. Others… keep their options open.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "900946627": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 654701748,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So… lie?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1859818531": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 654701748,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Oh, absolutely! But make it attractive.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1877557305": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1519309749
   ],
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh, {PC}, fancy running into you. Just a quick detour before indulging in some trashy reality TV with your {M}.",
   "settings": {
